---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const youtubeVideos = [
  { id: "X7LsqXgP3OE", title: "About Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop" },
  { id: "VjokdN58O80", title: "Dream to Design" },
  { id: "4CyfTb-V2bw", title: "Classic to Contemporary" },
];
---

<Layout title="About | Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="py-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-wood text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl text-darkwood mb-8">Creating Beautiful Cabinetry Since 1967</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop began over fifty years ago in a converted chicken house on a farm along the Snitz Creek in Lebanon, Pennsylvania. What started as a passion for creating elegance in homes has grown into a local icon for fine custom cabinetry.</p>
        <p>The tradition of hand-crafted cabinets from solid wood remains at the heart of what we do. As a family-owned and operated company, our reputation has spread throughout the region, and the demand for excellent cabinetry has grown well beyond the grassy banks of Snitz Creek.</p>
        <p>We take pride in our quality and design. Each year more people choose Snitz Creek to enhance the beauty of their kitchens, baths, and entertainment areas. In 2007 and 2008 we were honored with the prestigious LCBA Award for kitchen remodels and additions.</p>
        <p>Today we continue the same commitment: blending the precision of computerized equipment with the care of traditional hand skills.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Snitz Green -->
      <div class="mt-20 pt-12 border-t border-wood/20">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-8">Snitz’s Green</h2>

        <img 
          src="https://snitzcreek.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/About-Us-Banner.jpg" 
          alt="Drone view of the shop with solar panels" 
          class="w-full h-auto max-h-[70vh] object-cover rounded-lg mb-12"
        />

        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-charcoal/85 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            At Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop, we are committed to being good stewards of the earth and the natural resources we were given. Since 1996 we have been using a biomass heating system that supports environmental responsibility and economy. Biomass gasification boilers convert wood, sawdust and other organic waste products into usable heat.
          </p>

          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-darkwood mb-4">The environmental benefits of our wood gasification boiler are three-fold:</p>
            <div class="space-y-4 pl-1">
              <div class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="text-wood font-medium mt-0.5">1.</span>
                <p><span class="font-medium text-darkwood">Reduce landfill waste</span> — We recycle all our wood, laminate, cardboard and office by-products by converting them to heat energy.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="text-wood font-medium mt-0.5">2.</span>
                <p><span class="font-medium text-darkwood">Reduce emissions</span> — Our boiler converts wood to gas, then burns the gases. This gasification burning method reduces emissions and supports clean air.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="text-wood font-medium mt-0.5">3.</span>
                <p><span class="font-medium text-darkwood">Maintain the carbon footprint</span> — The EPA defines biomass consumption as “carbon neutral.” The carbon dioxide released by burning or decay equals the carbon dioxide stored by the growing tree.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p>
            Since we started heating with a gasification boiler, our oil consumption stopped. Every year we burn five to six thousand gallons less oil by using our waste.
          </p>

          <p>
            We work with suppliers who ensure sustainable forestry.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- YouTube Videos — playable embeds -->
      <div class="mt-20 pt-12 border-t border-wood/20">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-8">Snitz Creek TV</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {youtubeVideos.map((video) => (
            <div>
              <div class="relative aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded bg-black">
                <iframe
                  src={`https://www.youtube.com/embed/${video.id}?rel=0`}
                  title={video.title}
                  class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full"
                  frameborder="0"
                  allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                  allowfullscreen
                ></iframe>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-darkwood">{video.title}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-wood/20">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-darkwood mb-6">Also from Snitz Creek</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/snitzgreen" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wood hover:text-darkwood text-lg font-medium">Snitz Green on Instagram</a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@snitzcreektv" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wood hover:text-darkwood text-lg font-medium">Snitz Creek TV</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
